flowchart TD
    Q[DB quote / owner / expiry / snapshot] --> C[CREATED]
    C --> F[CONFIRMED]
    C --> CANCEL[CANCELLED]
    F --> CANCEL
    F -->|HOME_PICKUP| A[PICKUP_ASSIGNED]
    A -->|courier proof| P[PICKED_UP]
    A --> CANCEL
    P -->|independent branch handoff receipt| O[AT_ORIGIN_BRANCH]
    F -->|BRANCH_DROPOFF / physical intake| O
    O -->|COLLECTION / IN_TRANSIT / receipt| H1[AT_ORIGIN_HUB]
    H1 -->|LINEHAUL / IN_TRANSIT / receipt| H2[AT_DESTINATION_HUB]
    H2 -->|DISTRIBUTION / IN_TRANSIT / receipt| D[AT_DESTINATION_BRANCH]
    D -->|assign / prepare / accept / start| OUT[OUT_FOR_DELIVERY]
    OUT -->|proof| OK[DELIVERED]
    OUT -->|attempt + reason| FAIL[DELIVERY_FAILED]
    FAIL -->|redelivery decision + custody guards| OUT
    FAIL --> R[RETURNING]
    R --> REC[Courier recovery + independent branch receipt]
    REC --> REV[Destination branch → destination hub → origin hub → origin branch]
    REV -->|sender receipt| END[RETURNED]
